# MyConspect handbook

Public study handbook. Browse-only. Parse `resources/*.md` at **build time**.

## Product constraints

- Routes: `/` tracks → `/[track]` topic cards → `/[track]/[topic]` one accordion page
- Native `<details>`/`<summary>`. Full concept HTML on first load. Do **not** fetch on click
- No per-concept URLs, progress, quiz, auth, localStorage, or SRS
- SSG via `generateStaticParams`. `generateMetadata` on topic pages. `app/sitemap.ts` + `app/robots.ts`
- TypeScript, no `any`. English UI copy

## Content

- Read **only** `resources/` numbered `*_*.md` files (see `lib/content/catalog.ts`)
- Do not rewrite study notes unless the user asks. Do not add React to markdown
- Skip personal/hub files that are not in the catalog (`0_me.md`, `0_interview.md`, `3_js.md`, …)

## Example

```tsx
// ✅ accordion already in the document
<details id={concept.id}>
  <summary>{concept.title}</summary>
  <div dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{ __html: concept.html }} />
</details>

// ❌ client fetch of the body
onClick={() => fetch(`/api/concepts/${id}`)}
```
